1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Natila the daughter of Janab from the clan of Namr.
2 CONT
2 CONT She bore Abdul-Muttalib two sons: Al-Abbas and Dirar.
2 CONT
2 CONT She famously lost her son Al-Abbas and vowed to cover the Kaaba in Mecca with fine linens if she found him. She soon after found him and became the first one to place the Kiswa on the Kaaba in Makkah. The Kiswa (cloak) is replaced
2 CONC  every year until now.
