2 CONT
2 CONT 34eme generation
2 CONT
2 CONT Abol jafar Mohammad Allah Akbar
2 CONT
2 CONT Hassan al-Aftas avait 5 fils: Abdollah Shahid, Ali, Omar, Hossein et Hossein Makhfouf. Abdollah Shahid fut execute par Harun al-Rashid, quant a Hossein Makhfoof, il est l'ancetre de la dynastie de Hezaveh de Farahan a laquelle app
2 CONC artient Abolghassem Ghaem Magham, et Ali al-Jerzy est le pere de Shahzadeh (prince) Mohammad lequel est enterre a Fam, Tafresh et la magnifique cour de la mosquee qui lui fut dediee fut construite par Khajeh Mu'umin (+1170 Hegire)
2 CONC , le frere de Amin al-Din bin Mohammad Hossein al-Hosseini pendant le regne de Shah Abbas II.
2 CONT
2 CONT حسن افطس پنج پسر داشته: عبدالله شهید، علی، عمر، حسین و حسین مکفوف. عبدالله شهید به دست هارون الرشید مقتول شده؛ و حسین مکفوف جد سادات هزاوة فراهان است که مرحوم میرزا ابوالقاسم قائم مقام از آنهاست؛ و علی الجرزی والد شاهزاده محمد است
2 CONC  که در فم تفرش مدفون گردیده و قبه و صحن مجلل او را خواجه مؤمن (فوت 1170 هجری) برادر امین الدین (امینا) بن محمد حسین الحسینی در زمان شاه عباس دوم بنا نموده اس
2 CONT
2 CONT 33eme generation
2 CONT ================
2 CONT Allameh Qutb Ravandi
2 CONT
2 CONT In 573 AH, Allameh    Qutbuddin Ravandi,   one of the brilliant figures of the Shiite world, passed away. Ravandi, a great   sixth-century scientist, has also trained   prominent students, including ...  Ali ibn   Muhammad al -Ma'
2 CONC idani,  
2 CONT
2 CONT Muhammad ibn Hassan Efts ibn Ali Asghar ibn Imam Zayn al-Abidine (AS) who reaches Imam Sajjad (AS) with four intermediaries and is the ancestor of the Supreme Leader.
2 CONT [...  This Imam is at the head of the Sadat Hussein dynasty. Prophet Sultan Muhammad is the father of Sultan Sayyid Ahmad, who is buried in Hazawa, and this nobleman, with four intermediaries, reaches to Imam Sajjad (AS) whose tom
2 CONC b is in honor of Sayyid Muhammad, Mashhad. Here are the testimonies of Sultan Muhammad Abed Mashhad Miqhan that we just visited on the way to Arak.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Sadat Hussein dynasty is a continuous succession to the late Sayyid Qutb al-Din, after Qutb al-Din there are two strings. One field is that of Sayyid Zahiruddin and Sayyid Fakhruddin, known as Mir Fakhra, who is (the Supreme L
2 CONC eader)'s dynasty. Sayyid Fakhruddin is one of (the Supreme Leader)'s ancestors who are descendants of Qutbuddin.
2 CONT
2 CONT [ Another branch of the descendants of Sayyid Qutb al-Din https://www.geni.com/people/601-Seid-Ghotbeddin-Tafreshi-patriarche-de-la-branche-Mir-Fakhrayee/6000000037193211684  is the family of the deputy of Farahani who were also g
2 CONC reat ones to reach Mirza Isa https://www.geni.com/people/Mirza-BOZORG-Issa-Farahani-GHAEM-MAGHAM-1/6000000036440094853  and later Mirza Abulqasim https://www.geni.com/people/Mirza-Abol-Ghassem-Farahani-GHAEM-MAGHAM-2/6000000036834
2 CONC 695186?through=6000000036440094853 the deputy of Farahani who are also from the same Sadat Hussein dynasty from Qutbuddin , Our (the Supreme Leader's) dynasty Sadat al-Tafrish and Ashtian region and so on, they are separated from 
2 CONC their dynasty, these were mostly people of science and religion, they were mostly political men.]
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Hassan Makhfoof
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT 34eme generation
2 CONT
2 CONT Abol jafar Mohammad Allah Akbar
2 CONT
2 CONT Hassan al-Aftas avait 5 fils: Abdollah Shahid, Ali, Omar, Hossein et Hossein Makhfouf. Abdollah Shahid fut execute par Harun al-Rashid, quant a Hossein Makhfoof, il est l'ancetre de la dynastie de Hezaveh de Farahan a laquelle app
2 CONC artient Abolghassem Ghaem Magham, et Ali al-Jerzy est le pere de Shahzadeh (prince) Mohammad lequel est enterre a Fam, Tafresh et la magnifique cour de la mosquee qui lui fut dediee fut construite par Khajeh Mu'umin (+1170 Hegire)
2 CONC , le frere de Amin al-Din bin Mohammad Hossein al-Hosseini pendant le regne de Shah Abbas II.
2 CONT
2 CONT حسن افطس پنج پسر داشته: عبدالله شهید، علی، عمر، حسین و حسین مکفوف. عبدالله شهید به دست هارون الرشید مقتول شده؛ و حسین مکفوف جد سادات هزاوة فراهان است که مرحوم میرزا ابوالقاسم قائم مقام از آنهاست؛ و علی الجرزی والد شاهزاده محمد است
2 CONC  که در فم تفرش مدفون گردیده و قبه و صحن مجلل او را خواجه مؤمن (فوت 1170 هجری) برادر امین الدین (امینا) بن محمد حسین الحسینی در زمان شاه عباس دوم بنا نموده اس
2 CONT
2 CONT 33eme generation
2 CONT
2 CONT ===
2 CONT Allameh Qutb Ravandi
2 CONT
2 CONT In 573 AH, Allameh Qutbuddin Ravandi, one of the brilliant figures of the Shiite world, passed away. Ravandi, a great sixth-century scientist, has also trained prominent students, including ... Ali ibn Muhammad al -Ma'idani,
2 CONT
2 CONT Muhammad ibn Hassan Efts ibn Ali Asghar ibn Imam Zayn al-Abidine (AS) who reaches Imam Sajjad (AS) with four intermediaries and is the ancestor of the Supreme Leader. [... This Imam is at the head of the Sadat Hussein dynasty. Pro
2 CONC phet Sultan Muhammad is the father of Sultan Sayyid Ahmad, who is buried in Hazawa, and this nobleman, with four intermediaries, reaches to Imam Sajjad (AS) whose tomb is in honor of Sayyid Muhammad, Mashhad. Here are the testimon
2 CONC ies of Sultan Muhammad Abed Mashhad Miqhan that we just visited on the way to Arak.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Sadat Hussein dynasty is a continuous succession to the late Sayyid Qutb al-Din, after Qutb al-Din there are two strings. One field is that of Sayyid Zahiruddin and Sayyid Fakhruddin, known as Mir Fakhra, who is (the Supreme L
2 CONC eader)'s dynasty. Sayyid Fakhruddin is one of (the Supreme Leader)'s ancestors who are descendants of Qutbuddin.
2 CONT
2 CONT [ Another branch of the descendants of Sayyid Qutb al-Din 601 - Seid Ghotbeddin - Tafreshi - patriarche de la branche Mir Fakhrayee is the family of the deputy of Farahani who were also great ones to reach Mirza Isa Mirza BOZORG I
2 CONC ssa Farahani GHAEM MAGHAM 1, * and later Mirza Abulqasim Mirza Abol Ghassem Sejjedi Farahani GHAEM MAGHAM 2, (*) the deputy of Farahani who are also from the same Sadat Hussein dynasty from Qutbuddin , Our (the Supreme Leader's) d
2 CONC ynasty Sadat al-Tafrish and Ashtian region and so on, they are separated from their dynasty, these were mostly people of science and religion, they were mostly political men.]
2 CONT
