2 CONT * Zetterstéen, K.V., and H. Busse. "Mu'izz al-Daula." The Encyclopedia of Islam, Volume VII. New Ed. Leiden: E.J. Brill, 1993. ISBN 90-04-09419-9
2 CONT * Gil, Moshe (1997). A History of Palestine, 634–1099. Cambridge: Cambridge University Press. ISBN 0-521-59984-9.
