2 CONT * Hamilton Alexander Rosskeen Gibb (1954). The Encyclopedia of Islam, Volume 6. Brill. ISBN 978-9-004-08112-3.
2 CONT * Uri M. Kupferschmidt (1987). The Supreme Muslim Council: Islam Under the British Mandate for Palestine. BRILL. ISBN 978-9-004-07929-8.
2 CONT * D.S. Richards (April 4, 2014). The Annals of the Saljuq Turks: Selections from Al-Kamil Fi'l-Ta'rikh of Ibn Al-Athir. Routledge. ISBN 978-1-317-83255-3.
2 CONT
