2 CONT     (Arabic for The Rightly Guided)
2 CONT     *at-Tābi li Mardhātillāh[3]
2 CONT     (Arabic for The Follower of Gods Will)
2 CONT     *al-Mubārak[3]
2 CONT     (Arabic for The Blessed)
2 CONT     *at-Tayyib[3]
2 CONT     (Arabic for The Pure)
