2 CONC AEwAw#v=onepage&q=Aka&f=false '''Continuity and Change in Medieval Persia'''] by Ann K.S. Lambton:
2 CONT
2 CONT Zubaida, the daughter of Berk-Yaruq, to whom Mas’ud b. Mohammad was married, dominated her husband.
2 CONT
2 CONT After her death, Mas'ud married a daughter of Qavurt in 1137/1138.
