1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Umm Bint Marwan b. 648
2 CONT
2 CONT Lineage	Banu Umayyah
2 CONT
2 CONT Full name (at birth)	Umm Bint Marwan
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents ♂ # Marwan ibn al-Hakam [Banu Umayyah] b. 28 March 623 d. 7 May 685
2 CONT
2 CONT ♀ Aisha Bint Uthman (Al-Umayyah) [Bani Umayyah] b. 623
2 CONT
2 CONT Events 648 birth:
2 CONT
2 CONT child birth: ♂ # Abd Al-Aziz ibn Musa [Banu Umayyah] d. 717
2 CONT
2 CONT 675 child birth: Cairo, Egypt, ♂ Uthman De Cordoba (Ibn Abu-Musa) [Bani Umayyah] b. 675 d. 731
2 CONT
2 CONT Personal and Family Information Umm was born about 0648 in Damascus (Damas, Dimashq ach-Cham), Syria , the daughter of Marwan ibn al-Hakam (I caliph of Damascus) and A'isha bint Uthman al-Umayyah.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her husband was Abu-Musá ibn Nusayr. They were married, but the date and place have not been found. Their two known children were Uthman (c0675-?) and Abdul Yazid al-Wallid (c0685-c0717).
2 CONT
2 CONT N. N. bint Marwân ibn al-Hakam b. circa 659
2 CONT
2 CONT Father	Marwân I ibn al-Hakam al-Qurayshi, 4th Umayyad Caliph b. 623, d. 685 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother	Aisha bint 'Uthman ibn 'Affan b. circa 617.  Of the Umayyad.
2 CONT
2 CONT  N. N. bint Marwân ibn al-Hakam was born circa 659. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter ofMarwân I ibn al-Hakam al-Qurayshi, 4th Umayyad Caliph and Aisha bint 'Uthman ibn 'Affan. 
2 CONT
2 CONT N. N. bint Marwân ibn al-Hakam married Musa ibn Nuseir el-Bekir al-Makkiyya in 679; Unproven
2 CONT
2 CONT .1 Family Musa ibn Nuseir el-Bekir al-Makkiyya b. 660, d. 718 
2 CONT
2 CONT Child	
2 CONT
2 CONT  'Abd al-Aziz ibn Musa al-Makkiyya+ b. c 680, d. 7172 
2 CONT
