1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''6th Shia Itna'shari Imaam/ 5th Shia Ismai'li Imaam'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Date of Ascension:
2 CONT * Period of Imamate:
2 CONT * Wilaadat (Birth): 17th Rabi' ul-Awwal 83 AH (23rd April 702 AD)
2 CONT * Wafaat (Death): 15th Shawwal 148 AH (7th December 765 AD)
2 CONT
2 CONT Source 1: Sahifa
2 CONT
2 CONT Source 2: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ja%27far_al-Sadiq
2 CONT
2 CONT Source 3: http://alhamdolillah.net/auliya/sadiq/sadiq.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT ID: I180895 
2 CONT
2 CONT Name: Abu Abd Allah , Ja'far Shia Imam al-Husayn 1 
2 CONT
