2 CONT # Chandra, Satish (2004), Medieval India: From Sultanat to the Mughals-Delhi Sultanat (1206-1526) - Part One, Har-Anand Publications, p. 40.
2 CONT # Grousset, Rene, The Empire of the Steppes, (Rutgers University Press, 1991), 260
