2 CONC  in 1237 CE, Kaykhusraw II became his successor in spite of Kayqubad’s favor towards Izz-al-Din. ref https://www.historicales.com/real-history-of-sultan-alaeddin-kayqubad-1-bin-kaykavus-i/
