1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT Sayyidna Abu Ali Hasan bin  Ahmad bin Dawood bin Muhammad bin Maimoon bin Amr bin Abdullaah bin Sayyidna  Muslim bin  Sayyidna Aqeel bn Maulaana Imaam  Abu Taalib was a great Daai of Maulaana Mehdi Billaah . He died on 14th of Rab
2 CONC i'ul Awwal 321 Hijri .  Maulaana Imaam Qaaim bi Amrillaah prayed Salaatul janaaza on him .  He was captured by Romans and was imprisoned for 7 long years .  He was a prolific author of books of high repute . He wrote 1.Kitaab Shaj
2 CONC aratul Burhaan.  2.Kitaab Alamn min al Haira and 3. Kitaab on the philosophy that Man was created via Rooh and Jism .
2 CONT
2 CONT NOTES BY MULLA SA'DULLAAH HUSAMI -28th July 2015.
