1 CONT [edit] Chinese popculture
1 CONT Hong Kong TVB made a TV drama about Li Shimin adventure based from the "Novel of the Prince of Qin of the Great Tang (??????)". TVB's 1983 martial arts drama "The Foundation" also featured a young Li Shimin prominently as one of i
1 CONC ts three leads (and later, villain). 
